 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. SIZES.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  X   PIC 99.
 01  Y   PIC 99.
 01  Q   PIC 9(3).
 01  R   PIC 99.
 01  Z   PIC 9.
 01  E   PIC 9.
 01  P   PIC 9V99.
 01  S   PIC S99.
 01  BIG PIC 9(5).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     MOVE 60 TO X. MOVE 0 TO E. MOVE 5 TO Y.
     ADD 50 TO X ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "S1 Y" END-ADD.
     DISPLAY "S1 60 " X.
     ADD 30 TO X ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "S2 N".
     MULTIPLY 2 BY X ON SIZE ERROR ADD 1 TO E.
     DISPLAY "S3 90 1 " X " " E.
     COMPUTE Y = X * 3 SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "S4 Y".
     DIVIDE 0 INTO X ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "S5 Y"
     END-DIVIDE.
     COMPUTE Y = 10 / 0 ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "S6 Y".
     ADD X 20 GIVING Y ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "S7 Y".
     DISPLAY "S7 05 90 " Y " " X.
     DIVIDE 7 INTO 100 GIVING Q REMAINDER R.
     DISPLAY "S8 014 02 " Q " " R.
     DIVIDE 2 INTO 7 GIVING Q ROUNDED REMAINDER R.
     DISPLAY "S9 004 01 " Q " " R.
     MOVE 5 TO Z. MOVE 9 TO R.
     DIVIDE 2 INTO 100 GIVING Z REMAINDER R
         ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "SA Y".
     DISPLAY "SA 5 09 " Z " " R.
     COMPUTE P = 9.999.
     COMPUTE P = 10.5 ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "SB Y".
     DISPLAY "SB 9.99 " P.
     ADD 95 TO X ON SIZE ERROR
         IF E = 1 DISPLAY "SC Y" ELSE DISPLAY "SC N"
         END-IF.
     MOVE -90 TO S.
     SUBTRACT 20 FROM S ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "SD Y".
     MOVE 0 TO BIG.
     PERFORM VARYING Z FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL Z > 8
         ADD Z TO BIG
     END-PERFORM.
     DISPLAY "SE 00036 " BIG.
     ADD 50 TO X.
     DISPLAY "SF N".
     STOP RUN.
